==================================================================================================
 READING (honest)
==================================================================================================
  * (i) mean = (6/7)^13 > 0 is unconditional (main term).  (A) = the error does not swamp it at a good q.
  * COMMENSURATE pairs (covering shares 2,3,..) give OVERLAP => N >= main (helps) -- corrects 'resonance bad'.
  * the pair error kernel is a Dedekind sum ~1.5(log q)^2 (badly-approx r): small vs the O(q) main term for q large.
  * NOT CLOSED: the no-witness case needs an ADVERSARIAL anti-commensurate tiling of the 13 bad-sets; bounding
    its frequency to O(log M) moduli (=> a good q at O(log M loglog M)) is mac-mini's capacity argument (HYP-4054).
  This tool gives (A) its exact circle-method form; the residual is the geometry-of-numbers capacity bound.
DONE.
